{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50982","headline":"耒阳杜工部墓（题拟） · 孟宾于","name":"耒阳杜工部墓（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南游何感思，更甚叶缤纷。\n一夜耒江雨，百年工部文。\n青山当日见，白酒至今闻。\n惟有爲诗者，经过时吊君。\n（见钱谦益《笺注杜工部集唱酬题就是》引《耒阳祠志》。\n《增修诗话总龟》卷四三引刘斧《摭遗》引「一夜耒江雨，百年工部文」二句，称爲「唐人诗」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟宾于","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50982.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50982","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}